# MetisClip engine, dev only (never bundled). Copy to .env if you need it.
#
# No credentials here. API keys are never read from .env, not even in dev:
# enter them in MetisClip > Pengaturan (or the Setup Wizard). They are kept in
# Windows Credential Manager (service "MetisClip-Dev" for the dev engine).
# LLM provider, model, base URL and the Whisper model are app settings too.

# Only needed when running the engine alone, without Electron (CLAUDE.md §11):
# METISCLIP_ENV=dev
# METISCLIP_DATA_ROOT=.\.devdata
# MONGODB_URI=mongodb://127.0.0.1:27017/metisclip
